<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, position: 'relative' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: 1280, height: 76, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 100, paddingRight: 60 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>加权与阈值移动是等价的</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#B9CDEC', letterSpacing: 1 }}>03 / 06</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 100, top: 128, width: 600, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', letterSpacing: 1, marginBottom: 12 }}>加权训练：损失函数逐点最小化解</Text>

        <Box style={{ width: 600, background: '#F7F9FC', padding: '24px 30px 18px 30px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18, height: 92 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, color: '#1A2230' }}>p̂<span style={{ fontSize: 16 }}>w</span>(x) =</Text>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', gap: 5 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>w · η(x)</Text>
                    <Box style={{ height: 2, width: 236, background: '#1A2230' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>w · η(x) + 1 − η(x)</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 10 }}>式 (4-5)　w 为正类权重，η 为真实后验</Text>
        </Box>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', margin: '16px 0 12px 0' }}>令 p̂ ≥ 0.5，两边同乘分母并化简</Text>

        <Box style={{ width: 600, background: '#F7F9FC', padding: '24px 30px 18px 30px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, height: 92 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, color: '#1A2230' }}>η(x) ≥</Text>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', gap: 5 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>1</Text>
                    <Box style={{ height: 2, width: 92, background: '#1A2230' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>1 + w</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 10 }}>式 (4-6)　阈值被等比例改写，与 w 一一对应</Text>
        </Box>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            取 w = ρ = 10，得 η* = 1/(1+ρ) = <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>0.091</span> —— 正是上一页那道门槛
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 760, top: 128, width: 420, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', letterSpacing: 1, marginBottom: 22 }}>这意味着什么</Text>

        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, marginBottom: 24 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>01</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>加权 + 0.5 阈值，与不加权 + 0.091 阈值，给出<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>完全相同的决策</span></Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB', marginBottom: 24 }} />

        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, marginBottom: 24 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>02</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>但它成立的前提是概率校准，而加权本身会破坏校准（Brier 0.24 对 0.14）</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB', marginBottom: 24 }} />

        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>03</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>所以「测加权」与「测阈值」<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>不能互相替代</span>，必须各设一组消融</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 100, top: 592, width: 1080, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: '18px 28px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            若阈值已经单独搜索过一遍，加权所做的功就被重复计算了一次 —— 这是本文实验设计的方法论前提
        </Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
